{
    "word": "microchip",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "ecbad539-2df3-34df-bb5c-f5d7c4cd8e12",
                "word": "microchip",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "570bd4aa-87e7-4b4f-97df-82af691e082c",
                        "entry_id": "ecbad539-2df3-34df-bb5c-f5d7c4cd8e12",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "microchips"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2bda5cc8-8f8c-35af-8379-06bdaaed3155",
                        "entry_id": "ecbad539-2df3-34df-bb5c-f5d7c4cd8e12",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An integrated circuit."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4c4e4046-75e1-38f2-b507-177e6ca5924d",
                        "entry_id": "ecbad539-2df3-34df-bb5c-f5d7c4cd8e12",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An integrated circuit.",
                            "A microprocessor."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "87dc9cfb-ff96-4638-8cc3-b3f0c72302a8",
                                "sense_id": "4c4e4046-75e1-38f2-b507-177e6ca5924d",
                                "text": "By the early 2020s, the strategic priority level of microchip fabrication prowess and capacity had only grown."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7c06db6d-a716-4258-8845-ce7fc7ffba32",
                                "sense_id": "4c4e4046-75e1-38f2-b507-177e6ca5924d",
                                "text": "The base of the antenna contains a few microchips, whose purpose Hiro cannot divine by looking at them."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0203b6e7-d863-470c-8a02-3e160812cbdd",
                                "sense_id": "4c4e4046-75e1-38f2-b507-177e6ca5924d",
                                "text": "And so the microchip, say, reflects a certain electronically driven speed of society, just as the invention of a flint axe, reflected a society that was rhythmed fully by biological and environmental temporalities."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3798ef80-4792-440a-afcf-295bc707b0b5",
                                "sense_id": "4c4e4046-75e1-38f2-b507-177e6ca5924d",
                                "text": "Previous attempts at designing self-cooling microchips have largely relied on a two-pronged approach, involving designing the cooling elements separately from the electronic elements, and then combining after the initial fabrication process."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b08cfc82-3627-4658-824b-4acb32c05bd1",
                        "source_entry_id": "ecbad539-2df3-34df-bb5c-f5d7c4cd8e12",
                        "source_sense_description": "integrated circuit",
                        "target_lang_word": "micropuce",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "micropuce",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5f425619-3f56-31a1-94e1-5327356e6926",
                                        "entry_id": "38bf35aa-5994-33fb-a962-80dd78072105",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Puce électronique contenant un code unique et servant à identifier et répertorier les animaux domestiques."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b8e11634-7b68-3ad8-a2e2-0429b7a25f4b",
                                        "entry_id": "38bf35aa-5994-33fb-a962-80dd78072105",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Composant électronique de petite taille reproduisant une ou plusieurs fonctions électroniques plus ou moins complexes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3182426e-a7fe-4ac7-94f8-55b94763522d",
                                                "sense_id": "b8e11634-7b68-3ad8-a2e2-0429b7a25f4b",
                                                "text": "Fébrile, elle se connecte grâce à la micropuce installée dans sa montre, qui émet un signal seulement avec l’autre montre identique que porte Emmanuelle, mais qui visiblement ne fonctionnait plus ces derniers temps."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6c7f1c79-d9b3-407b-94f7-ac7c2496ee77",
                        "source_entry_id": "ecbad539-2df3-34df-bb5c-f5d7c4cd8e12",
                        "source_sense_description": "integrated circuit",
                        "target_lang_word": "Mikrochip",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Mikrochip",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b0138d0f-1808-393d-b11a-f54c2d16e687",
                                        "entry_id": "e87323f8-b50c-3379-943c-e7f5d855d895",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine besonders kleine Die, ein Halbleiterplättchen mit Schaltkreis"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bc90e1a-e822-41d2-9773-08a3dc0b9bfe",
                                                "sense_id": "b0138d0f-1808-393d-b11a-f54c2d16e687",
                                                "text": "In meinem Computer ist ein hochwertiger Mikrochip verbaut."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17f1fd9b-0df6-4564-81c7-1536675d6ea9",
                                                "sense_id": "b0138d0f-1808-393d-b11a-f54c2d16e687",
                                                "text": "„Um ein konkretes Anwendungsbeispiel für den Mikrochip vorlegen zu können, machte sich Kilby 1966 mit seinen Kollegen Jerry Merryman und James Van Tessel daran, den ersten Taschenrechner der Welt zu konstruieren.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18c0dff3-27fb-4320-9c82-205239348382",
                                                "sense_id": "b0138d0f-1808-393d-b11a-f54c2d16e687",
                                                "text": "„IBM war davon überzeugt, dass mit dem Mikrochip nichts Sinnvolles anzufangen ist.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
